# ETL intermediates; all of them can be regenerated with npm run etl and stay
# out of the repo. The copy the browser needs is under public/data, and that
# one is committed. The only thing kept is REPORT.md: it is the coverage
# diagnostic and counts as documentation. postnumre.json is kept too: it is
# the last extract DAWA served before it closed and cannot be downloaded again.
data/*.geojson
data/*.parquet
data/kommuner.json
data/areas.json

# DuckDB's wasm + worker total 77 MB. Kept out of the repo: the postinstall
# of npm install copies them deterministically from node_modules.
public/duckdb/

# Static export output
out/

__pycache__/
